Day 2 — Web Scraping & Data Extraction Pipeline

** Built functional web scraper using BeautifulSoup to parse job listings from HTML
** Identified key page structure elements for:
        ** Job titles
        ** Company names
        ** Job locations
** Extracted structured job data from unstructured HTML content
** Stored scraped data in Python dictionaries and organized multiple records into lists
** Cleaned raw text data to remove formatting inconsistencies and improve readability
** Converted extracted dataset into structured format using Pandas
** Exported job data into CSV file (jobs.csv) for persistence and offline access

Outcome:
Created a working ETL-style pipeline (Extract → Transform → Load) for real job data.
